  ('c2195b5a-075a-5e0a-981d-b3ea61544a76', 'AU-84F24', '00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001', 'henry-drummond', 'Henry Drummond', null, 'Henry Drummond (1851 to 1897). Real author. The original text is in the public domain; the workbook around it is new Akana material.', 'GB', null, null, 'en-GB', false, true, 'active'),
